      "id": "b0e732a3-8df7-425e-a5f1-63d049a6f793",
      "name": "Authorization",
      "description": {
        "content": "Pure Storage uses the OAuth 2.0 Token Exchange authorization grant and JSON Web Tokens (JWTs)\nto authenticate to the Pure Storage REST API.\nBefore you can exchange the ID token for an access token, create and enable the API client\nto generate the `key_id`, `id`, and `issuer` values.\nThese values will be used as JWT claims for the `subject_token` parameter.\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
